[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0010","text":"——制作人，那个孩子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0020","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0021","text":"孩子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0030","text":"妈妈～～～～！你在哪里？\n呜呜呜……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0040","text":"是童星……不对，是普通的孩子吗……？\n来参观儿童节目什么的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0050","text":"啊……不管怎样，一个人太可怜了\n我去跟她说说话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0060","text":"你好，你没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0070","text":"！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0080","text":"我们一起去找妈妈吧\n别哭了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0090","text":"……！！！！\n……好可怕……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_01_0100","text":"诶…………"}]
